<http://data.silknow.org/object/5323e5ad-1090-3969-a22a-2ab6280d85bd/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Lacis, silk net embroidered with silk.\nThe left hand side is longer than the right hand side. Double-sided embroidery on hand-made dark brown silk net. There is a border in which a blue and light blue star-like flower alternates with a diagonal bar in the same colours running between 2 pink flower heads.  In places there is a dark red thread running along as an edge to either side of the border. The central panel is divided into a diamond lattice by dark green lines with 4 small light coloured tri-lobed motifs where the lines cross.  Each diamond contains an octagon with a flower with a yellow centre and 4 red petals or light green centre and 4 pink petals; the colours are arranged in diagonal lines.  The octagons are brown for the red petals and red for the pink petals."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/5323e5ad-1090-3969-a22a-2ab6280d85bd> .

<http://data.silknow.org/event/74b744fb-daf5-3eab-b717-67e01a254b25>
