<http://data.silknow.org/object/5323e5ad-1090-3969-a22a-2ab6280d85bd>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "embroidered net, 1800s, Persian"@en , "Lacis, silk net embroidered with silk.\nThe left hand side is longer than the right hand side. Double-sided embroidery on hand-made dark brown silk net. There is a border in which a blue and light blue star-like flower alternates with a diagonal bar in the same colours running between 2 pink flower heads.  In places there is a dark red thread running along as an edge to either side of the border. The central panel is divided into a diamond lattice by dark green lines with 4 small light coloured tri-lobed motifs where the lines cross.  Each diamond contains an octagon with a flower with a yellow centre and 4 red petals or light green centre and 4 pink petals; the colours are arranged in diagonal lines.  The octagons are brown for the red petals and red for the pink petals."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/bf3559dd-182f-3e73-bca2-4b4b7e12e3f2> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "embroidered net, 1800s, Persian"@en , "Lacis, silk net embroidered with silk.\nThe left hand side is longer than the right hand side. Double-sided embroidery on hand-made dark brown silk net. There is a border in which a blue and light blue star-like flower alternates with a diagonal bar in the same colours running between 2 pink flower heads.  In places there is a dark red thread running along as an edge to either side of the border. The central panel is divided into a diamond lattice by dark green lines with 4 small light coloured tri-lobed motifs where the lines cross.  Each diamond contains an octagon with a flower with a yellow centre and 4 red petals or light green centre and 4 pink petals; the colours are arranged in diagonal lines.  The octagons are brown for the red petals and red for the pink petals."@en ;
